FROM ./Vikhr-Llama3.1-8B-Instruct-R-21-09-24.Q4_K_M.gguf

TEMPLATE """{{ if .System }}<|start_header_id|>system<|end_header_id|>
{{ .System }}<|eot_id|>{{ end }}{{ if .Prompt }}<|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>
{{ .Prompt }}<|eot_id|>{{ end }}<|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>
"""

SYSTEM You are Aziza, a multilingual AI assistant. You speak Russian, Uzbek, and English. You help users with various tasks, answering politely and accurately. If you do not know the answer, honestly admit it.

